# A complex split with a stated rule, a default flow and its inserted join.
# covers: §4.3, §7.1, §7.5
title "Paper review"

start Paper submitted
complex Enough reviews? [rule: Continue when 2 of the 3 reviews are in]
  first: user Review by the chair
  second: user Review by a member
  else: service Ask an external reviewer
task Decide
end Decision made
